      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "משתין בקיר",
      "rationale": "'Yo a ntšhago mogo kgahlanong le lerago' ke modumo wa Semitic wa go bolela monna yo mongwe le yo mongwe; diphetoše tše dingwe di bolela fela 'monna' goba 'mosimane'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "מהרע אתך",
      "rationale": "Seheberu se re 'go go dira bobe ⟨את⟩' — modumo wa go ya ka ntle, e sego 'go go hlaja'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "כי אם",
      "rationale": "Kopanyo ye e ra 'go se be … ntle le' — mantšu a phethagetšego a bolela gore go ka be go sa šetšwe selo go Nawale."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "Abigale",
      "rationale": "Dafida o bolela le Abigale ka tlasego, a mo laola ka 'go go dira bobe'."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme fela, go fihla ge Yahwe, Elohim wa Yisraele, a phela, yo a mpitilego go go dira bobe ⟨את⟩ — ka gobane ge o sa ka wa gapa o wa tla go mpotela, go ka be go sa šetšwego go Nawale go fihla go bontšha bosasa o tee yo a ntšhago mogo kgahlanong le lerago.",
